---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="About — ironoa" description="About ironoa validator operations and philosophy.">
  <h1 class="h1"><i class="mdi mdi-information-outline"></i> About</h1>
  <p>Independent validator operations in the Polkadot ecosystem since 2020 — today active on Kusama.</p>

  <div class="panel">
    <h2 class="h2"><i class="mdi mdi-strategy"></i> Operational Strategy</h2>
    <h3 style="font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 600; margin-top: 1rem;">Kusama: Decentralization</h3>
    <p>Self-hosted on owned hardware in Southern Switzerland. The validator ran from a rented datacenter until September 2026 and moved home to put one less intermediary between the operator and the machine.</p>

    <h3 style="font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 600; margin-top: 1rem;">Polkadot: Decentralization (retired 2026)</h3>
    <p>Until 2026 we also validated on Polkadot from that same self-hosted infrastructure, prioritizing independence and network decentralization. The validator was wound down after the Web3 Foundation sunset the Decentralized Nodes program — see <a href="/polkadot" style="text-decoration: underline;">Polkadot</a>.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="panel">
    <h2 class="h2"><i class="mdi mdi-shield-check"></i> Operations</h2>
    <ul class="kv">
      <li><span>Location</span><code>Switzerland</code></li>
      <li><span>Operating Since</span><code>2020</code></li>
      <li><span>Monitoring</span><code>External 24/7 alerting system</code></li>
      <li><span>Infrastructure</span><code>Self-hosted, owned hardware</code></li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="panel">
    <h2 class="h2"><i class="mdi mdi-certificate"></i> Program Participation</h2>
    <p><strong>Kusama:</strong> Operated independently since 2020. Initially participated in the 1KV Program until its shutdown.</p>
    <p style="margin-top: 0.75rem;"><strong>Polkadot (retired):</strong> Selected for Web3 Foundation's Decentralized Nodes Program Cohort 3 — the final cohort before the Foundation sunset the program (announced December 2025). Previously in the 1KV Program until its shutdown.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="panel">
    <h2 class="h2"><i class="mdi mdi-target"></i> Focus Areas</h2>
    <ul style="margin-left: 1.25rem; line-height: 1.8;">
      <li>Zero slashing incidents since 2020</li>
      <li>High-performance hardware with ECC memory and redundant storage</li>
      <li>Dedicated external monitoring for proactive issue detection</li>
      <li>Network decentralization through unique infrastructure choices</li>
      <li>Transparent communication with nominators</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</Base>
